# Binaries the harness lets execute for real, read-only, against the read-only
# bind-mounted filesystem (or the isolated loopback-only network namespace for
# curl). Deliberately curated, not "everything not otherwise mentioned" — see
# FINDINGS.md for why an allowlist-of-safe beats a blocklist-of-unsafe here.
